- 6.6–9 s stage_3: Final node completes the journey.. Motion: Trim finishes; final node gets one restrained emphasis.
- 9–12 s outcome_and_cta: Entire journey is visible with a concrete next step.. Motion: Pull back <=8%; hold CTA >=2 s.

